  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "The RSK Bridge is a canonical bridge that enables the transfer of assets between the Ethereum and RSK blockchains. It uses a federated model to lock tokens on one chain and mint equivalent tokens on the other, ensuring interoperability.",
    "relationship_narrative": "The Bridge contract is the core operational contract, upgraded via AdminUpgradeabilityProxy, and interacts with SideToken to represent bridged assets. The Federation and AllowTokens contracts (not in the family but present as proxies) likely provide access control and token whitelisting for the bridge.",
